<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/8/msa@/~cl_14__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) If the Inquiry Officer is satisfied that there are no sufficient grounds for believing that the person who was the subject of the inquiry is a member of any of the registrable categories, he shall report his finding, together with his reasons for it, to the Board, and shall forward a copy of his finding to the officer having custody of the person, who shall forthwith serve a copy of the finding of the Inquiry Officer on that person.”;"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/8/msa@> .
